# Ship ONLY the app. Before 2026-10-21 every file in this repo was public on
# psstock.vercel.app: CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md, all supabase/*.sql + Edge Function source,
# deploy scripts, server.js, scratch pages. Allowlist: ignore everything at the root,
# then re-include what the browser actually loads. A NEW runtime file (a .jsx is
# covered) must be added here, or it 404s in production while working locally.
# Keep .wranglerignore (Cloudflare Pages) in step.
/*
!/Inventory Management System.html
!/*.jsx
!/boot.js
!/sw.js
!/styles.css
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/thai-address.json
!/apple-touch-icon.png
!/favicon-32.png
!/icon-192.png
!/icon-512.png
!/icon-maskable-512.png
!/fonts
# UI illustrations (ILLUS in icons.jsx) — without this every picture 404s in prod.
!/img
!/vercel.json
